text Fourth period begins.
text I'm usually lazy, but I tend to perk up a bit around this time of day.
text Kotomi is probably on her way to the library.
text I, on the other hand, am forced to kill time while staring daggers at the teacher's back.
text There's absolutely no opening.
text Rather, he's totally got eyes in the back of his head.
text Being truant over the past few days must have triggered this.
text I'm trapped until the lunch bell rings.
text On top of that, the class runs long by five minutes.
